          'Rules:\n'
          '- Only include tasks that are explicitly specified and have all '
          'required arguments present in the TODO content.\n'
          '- Do not invent channel names, user names, emails, URLs, or message '
          "bodies. Use exactly what's provided.\n"
          "- For channel names, omit a leading '#'.\n"
          '- If an email address is provided, you may use it directly (no need '
          'to search or infer anything else).\n'
          '- If a task lacks required information (e.g., missing email for an '
